# Useful Scripts Collection

A small archive of handy bash and python scripts for automating daily tasks, managing server deployments, and configuring local environments.

## Planned Additions
- `sys-update.sh`: A quick one-liner to update and clean apt packages.
- `docker-wipe.sh`: Utility to prune dangling Docker images and containers.
- `net-check.sh`: A simple ping and DNS resolver script to verify network connectivity.

Feel free to fork if you find anything useful!
